From: HiDeck maintainers
Subject: Allow libbase headers on musl without sys/cdefs.h

This header is used only to detect Bionic. OpenWrt's musl does not provide it;
retain detection on platforms that do, without requiring a glibc-only header.

--- a/vendor/libbase/include/android-base/test_utils.h
+++ b/vendor/libbase/include/android-base/test_utils.h
@@ -20 +20,3 @@
-#include <sys/cdefs.h>
+#if __has_include(<sys/cdefs.h>)
+#include <sys/cdefs.h>
+#endif
